      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/9de053/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-06-20T14:26:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Matchstickman&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Matchstickman\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yep, the heroes luck out as Citizen Autumn is very fickle in her attentions (or it was a well played tactical decision, YOU decide!).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>We had a great game going once where we’d decided to go for ‘No Flipping dawn’ where our opponents in addition to Dawn were Citizen Summer, Dawn, and Hammer.</p>\n<p>I was Ra with Flesh of the sungod, so, that was Summer and Hammer gone, Our lowest HP hero was Bunker, who wasn’t getting any use out of Ammo Drop anyways. Tachyon and Bunker built up for their big combos, and Fanatic kept wailing away at Dawn.<br>\nGame went fairly quickly, but we also got lucky.</p>",
